# ARCHIVED (superseded): first UC1 series (2026-09-30..10-04), 6 customers bath2..bath7 (bath3 included), all boards on 2.4 GHz Wi-Fi; superseded by the final 5-customer mixed Wi-Fi series uc1-*5mx7-* (bath2 bath4-bath7; bath3 dead since 2026-10-05) — see results/pi/README.md
